---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import whoimage from "../images/yoga.svg";
import storyimage from "../images/story.svg";
import ContactForm from "../components/ContactFormNetlify.astro";
const pageTitle = "Jo Dobozi";
---

<BaseLayout pageTitle={pageTitle}>
  <div class="container">
    <article>
      <div class="intro">
        <p>Hi, I'm Jo, a Business Intelligence and Research Executive.</p>
        <p>
          Lorem, ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Pariatur
          accusamus ipsa et odit voluptate ut sit laudantium perspiciatis,
          possimus, quibusdam ea architecto autem distinctio necessitatibus,
          explicabo ad nostrum id reprehenderit!
        </p>
        <p>
          Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Sed, quidem
          est impedit suscipit deleniti autem ullam in hic velit praesentium
          ipsa magni minima corporis? Quaerat numquam libero enim sit. Nihil.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article>
      <div class="grid" id="who">
        <div>
          <Image src={whoimage} alt="Who I Am" />
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2>Who I Am</h2>
          <p>
            Our driving passion is to understand what makes people tick. To
            really understand what unites us, what sets us apart and how that
            impacts the communication we respond to.
          </p>
          <p>
            We also know where and how to source insights, filter out what’s
            important, make sense of what we have learnt and help apply what’s
            essential.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article>
      <div class="grid" id="story">
        <div class="fp-2">
          <h2>This is My Story</h2>
          <p>
            Everything we do has an element of strategy. We can’t help
            ourselves.
          </p>
          <p>
            We specialise in brand positioning, brand repositioning, brand
            architecture and brand creation. All things related to brands.
          </p>
          <p>
            Planning tools are an important part of the process, but brand
            issues are bespoke, and therefore handled accordingly.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="fp-1">
          <Image src={storyimage} alt="My Story" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
    <h2 id="contact">Get In Touch</h2>
    <p style="text-align: center">
      I would love to hear from you. Just complete the form below and I shall
      get back to you as soon as I can.
    </p>
    <article>
      <ContactForm />
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style lang="scss">
  .intro {
    // font-size: 1.25rem;
  }
  #contact {
    text-align: center;
  }
  html {
    scroll-padding-top: 3rem;
  }
  @media only screen and (max-width: 768px) {
    .fp-1 {
      order: 1;
    }
    .fp-2 {
      order: 2;
    }
  }
</style>
